{"_id":"68a736318ec3d8323af1ce16","nodeId":"D5_O-uElftYGQr_bTU_se","roadmapSlug":"react","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:28.899Z","description":"# useContext\n\nThe `useContext` Hook lets us share data between components without having to pass props down through every level of the component tree. This is particularly useful when many components need to access the same data or when components are deeply nested.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Using useContext","url":"https://react.dev/reference/react/useContext","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c14f"},{"type":"official","title":"Explore the concept of context","url":"https://react.dev/learn/passing-data-deeply-with-context","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c150"},{"type":"video","title":"Learn useContext In 13 Minutes","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5LrDIWkK_Bc","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c151"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:25:49.234Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d04163ae","title":"Scrimba - Advanced React","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/advanced-react-c02h?via=roadmap"},{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d04163fe","title":"Scrimba - Build a Movie Search App in React","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/build-a-movie-search-app-in-react-c0u?via=roadmap"},{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d041644e","title":"Scrimba - Build Tic Tac Toe with React Hooks","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/build-tic-tac-toe-with-react-hooks-c0m?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/react/content/D5_O-uElftYGQr_bTU_se.md"}